  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> are subtracted respectively from four numbers in geometric progression, then&nbsp;the resulting numbers are in arithmetic progression.&nbsp;The smallest of the four numbers is"
  },
